# The Celimyn-Tuek option (scripts/check_celimyn_tuek.sh): the setup
# (dune_story_setup=celimyn) logs the sietch's discovery phase at new game,
# whether it is findable at phases 0x57 and 0x58, and the byte after a save
# with the original's 0xff and a reload; everything happens during the setup.
#
# Comments after '#' on a command line say what a click hits and what a
# wait lets finish; scripts/dune_script_trace.py prints what each line did.
wait 3000               # the story setup runs (the save and the reload)
checkpoint celimyn-end
quit
